{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 3, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 1396526669863200515, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "round_money rounds half up; other helpers intact\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {".pytest_cache/.gitignore": {"bytes": 37, "mtime": 1791872327.3399246, "sha256": "3ed731b65d06150c138e2dadb0be0697550888a6b47eb8c45ecc9adba8b8e9bd"}, ".pytest_cache/CACHEDIR.TAG": {"bytes": 191, "mtime": 1791872327.3399246, "sha256": "37dc88ef9a0abeddbe81053a6dd8fdfb13afb613045ea1eb4a5c815a74a3bde4"}, ".pytest_cache/README.md": {"bytes": 302, "mtime": 1791872327.3399246, "sha256": "73fd6fccdd802c419a6b2d983d6c3173b7da97558ac4b589edec2dfe443db9ad"}, ".pytest_cache/v/cache/nodeids": {"bytes": 512, "mtime": 1791872327.3399246, "sha256": "f9f96edd1b6fe92b355484cf124c108922c521731ec4e0d6fc35199fb2d6c060"}, "pricing/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "pricing/money.py": {"bytes": 639, "mtime": 1791872317.067931, "sha256": "7a3d63c374c3898dfc77e794908ea0274198b9461947d78285d4392f839694b2"}, "tests/test_round_money.py": {"bytes": 565, "mtime": 1791872321.5079176, "sha256": "1fb0a974672034669f144f79676778fd48917ca6f3d96c8459446b53256ac106"}, "tests/test_split.py": {"bytes": 101, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "f21bbe9cf15cf7f51ff9f71318aca4794c29f5d66cb9ae2aa0d4c919043d9bcf"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp", "-p", "`round_money(2.675)` returns `2.67` but customers expect `2.68`. Fix it.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/cap30-38/omp-38/transcripts/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/22/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/cap30-38/omp-38/cells/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/22/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/18.1.8 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Add a regression test covering the reported case and tie behavior:\n`round_money(2.675)` now returns `2.68`. I added `tests/test_round_money.py` with 7 cases, and it passes along with the existing `split` test (8 passed, run with pytest via `uv`).\n\n**Why it returned 2.67:** the computer can't store 2.675 exactly. It actually holds `2.67499999999999982\u2026`, so `round(x, 2)` rounds it down. Python's `round` also sends exact halves to the nearest even digit (`round(0.125, 2)` gives `0.12`), so it wasn't rounding half up as the function's docstring says.\n\n**Fix** in `pricing/money.py`:\n```python\nreturn float(Decimal(repr(x)).quantize(_CENT, rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP))\n```\n`repr(x)` turns the number back into its shortest written form (`\"2.675\"`). That is rounded half up as a decimal, so the result matches the price the customer sees. It still returns a `float`, so nothing that calls it needs to change. `add_vat` goes through `round_money`, so it now rounds half up too.\n\n**Tests:** `2.675\u21922.68`, `1.005\u21921.01`, `0.125\u21920.13`, `2.674\u21922.67`, `2.0\u21922.0`, `-2.675\u2192-2.68` (negative halves round away from zero), and an `add_vat` case that lands on 2.675.\n\n**Not fixed: `split` has a related bug.** It uses `int(total * 100)`, which cuts off decimals instead of rounding. For example, `0.29 * 100` comes out as `28.999\u2026`, so `base` is computed from 28 cents instead of 29. I didn't change it because it's outside what you asked for.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 9, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 242651, "requests_cache_write": 15991, "requests_cost_usd": 0.1755852, "requests_count": 9, "requests_input_uncached": 20, "requests_output": 2351, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-bugfix-regress:claude-opus-5-5:trial22", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 42, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-13T06:18:21.411568+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 32.908, "t_checker_s": 0.338, "t_env_setup_s": 0.01, "task": "trig-omp-bugfix-regress", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 360, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 2371, "tokens_cache_read": 242651, "tokens_cache_write": 15991, "tokens_fresh": 2371, "tokens_input_uncached": 20, "tokens_main_cache_read": 242651, "tokens_main_cache_write": 15991, "tokens_main_calls": 9, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 20, "tokens_main_output": 2351, "tokens_output": 2351, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 242651, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 15991, "tokens_proxy_calls": 9, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 20, "tokens_proxy_output": 2351, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 22, "ts_iso": "2026-10-13T02:18:21", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 9, "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 27104, "cacheWrite": 201, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "outp